{"3915120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SENARA: The Sacrament", "steam_appid": 3915120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SENARA: The Sacrament </strong></i>is a first-person survival horror game set aboard a massive, derelict ship, where faith, fanaticism, and abyssal horror collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on the <i>SENARA</i> for reasons unknown, you must survive and escape as it teeters on the edge of ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cult rituals, forbidden truths, and survivors with their own agendas await you in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61ef75d6f00ffa8ab396c2728b207265.poster.avif?t=1785472997\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61ef75d6f00ffa8ab396c2728b207265.webm?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/61ef75d6f00ffa8ab396c2728b207265.mp4?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival and Escape on a Sealed Ship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive within the meticulously recreated interior of a massive 6,000-ton ship, facing limited resources and constant threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the structure, discover hidden passages, and gather clues to find the key to your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/fcb4b359616b71bfb4abfc18537c8c5b.poster.avif?t=1785472997\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/fcb4b359616b71bfb4abfc18537c8c5b.webm?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/fcb4b359616b71bfb4abfc18537c8c5b.mp4?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle- and Exploration-Focused Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The densely designed spaces, based on a real ship, gradually open up as the chapters progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items such as documents, equipment, and keys to unlock sealed areas and navigate the complex, intertwined corridors on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing threats create fresh tension even within familiar surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/7c587dd84cfe7f74acb37112fca699fc.poster.avif?t=1785472997\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/7c587dd84cfe7f74acb37112fca699fc.webm?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/7c587dd84cfe7f74acb37112fca699fc.mp4?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounters with Constant Threatening Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanatics and bizarre, otherworldly beings relentlessly threaten you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must use limited weapons, strategic stealth, and evasive maneuvers to avoid detection and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/7a3de168daf9c9392e3c6a903a28beb3.poster.avif?t=1785472997\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/7a3de168daf9c9392e3c6a903a28beb3.webm?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/7a3de168daf9c9392e3c6a903a28beb3.mp4?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Active Story Interpretation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth behind all events is scattered like pieces across documents, objects, and conversations between characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must find and connect these fragments to construct the story for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on what you believe and how you interpret the clues, the story can unfold in entirely different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/922a3405a3a97a802f6d98ee8e3d2609.poster.avif?t=1785472997\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/922a3405a3a97a802f6d98ee8e3d2609.webm?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/922a3405a3a97a802f6d98ee8e3d2609.mp4?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings Based on Your Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your journey toward the end, you will face decisive moments of choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These decisions affect not only your escape but also the fate of the <i>SENARA</i> and the flow of truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can decide where this story ultimately leads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/f1d5c4814331e25395b80276d9727200.poster.avif?t=1785472997\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/f1d5c4814331e25395b80276d9727200.webm?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915120/extras/f1d5c4814331e25395b80276d9727200.mp4?t=1785472997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prologue Episode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Before the Dawn: SENARA Prologue</i></strong> is a short story that explores the past of one of the main characters from the main game, shedding light on the events that began aboard the <i>SENARA</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the first piece of the truth hidden within the confined spaces that continue into the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of this entire saga for free right now.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>SENARA: The Sacrament </strong></i>is a first-person survival horror game set aboard a massive, derelict ship, where faith, fanaticism, and abyssal horror collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on the <i>SENARA</i> for reasons unknown, you must survive and escape as it teeters on the edge of ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden cult rituals, forbidden truths, and survivors with their own agendas await you in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img